        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 24 at 9:40AM EDT until September 25 at 6:00AM EDT by NWS Baltimore MD/Washington DC</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northeast winds 15 to 20 kt with gusts up to 25 kt.

* WHERE...Choptank River to Cambridge MD and the Little Choptank
River and Patuxent River to Broomes Island MD.

* WHEN...Until 6 AM EDT Friday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
